DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The xxee interface provides access to a 10/100 Mb/s Ethernet network via a
     Xircom Ethernet card.  The Ethernet cards known to be supported by the xxee
     interface are:

           Xircom Realport
           Xircom CE3

     However, most 16-bit Xircom Ethernet cards should work.

